WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:17.808
Ethan was having a great afternoon.

2
00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:21.918
The Kids Central campers were on a nature hike in the woods.

3
00:00:21.919 --> 00:00:24.440
And Ethan loved the woods.

4
00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:36.417
Mr. Dunn was showing them moss and different kinds of wildflowers.

5
00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:41.789
"What's this?" Ethan asked, pointing to a small yellow flower.

6
00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:47.844
"That's a buttercup," Nina said. "It's so cute."

7
00:00:47.845 --> 00:00:53.456
"We're not touching anything today," Mr. Dunn called out sternly.

8
00:00:53.457 --> 00:00:57.923
"We're just observing—from the trail, Ethan!"

9
00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.571
"Ha-ha, Ethan!" Bobby teased him.

10
00:01:01.572 --> 00:01:06.942
"You got in trouble!"

11
00:01:06.943 --> 00:01:11.940
The next day Mr. Dunn asked everyone to draw a flower from the nature hike.

12
00:01:11.941 --> 00:01:15.747
"Hey, Ethan. What's on your leg?"

13
00:01:15.748 --> 00:01:19.375
Izzie pointed to red welts on Ethan's legs.

14
00:01:19.376 --> 00:01:22.501
Ethan was scratching like crazy.

15
00:01:22.502 --> 00:01:24.061
"I don't know.

16
00:01:24.062 --> 00:01:28.900
But it's so itchy," Ethan said.

17
00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:34.578
"Uh-oh. It looks like you've got poison ivy," Mr. Dunn said.

18
00:01:34.579 --> 00:01:37.368
"Are we going to get it too?"

19
00:01:37.369 --> 00:01:40.212
Jason backed away from Ethan.

20
00:01:40.213 --> 00:01:43.482
"Jason, you probably don't have to worry.

21
00:01:43.483 --> 00:01:48.284
But Ethan was wandering off the trail yesterday," Mr. Dunn said.

22
00:01:48.285 --> 00:01:51.725
"Sorry, Mr. Dunn," Ethan mumbled.

23
00:01:51.726 --> 00:01:54.878
"I should have stayed with the rest of the group."

24
00:01:54.879 --> 00:02:01.610
Mr. Dunn nodded. "The oil from the poison ivy plants must have gotten on your skin."

25
00:02:01.611 --> 00:02:05.606
"Oil?" said Jason. "What oil?"

26
00:02:05.607 --> 00:02:09.457
"Plants have oil?" Nina asked.

27
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:14.776
"It sounds like you campers need to learn about poison ivy," Mr. Dunn said.

28
00:02:14.777 --> 00:02:16.994
"Let's visit the library.

29
00:02:16.995 --> 00:02:20.047
We can look up facts about poison ivy.

30
00:02:20.048 --> 00:02:23.884
You can finish your pictures later."

31
00:02:23.885 --> 00:02:30.670
Mr. Dunn led the kids into the empty school library.

32
00:02:30.671 --> 00:02:35.320
"We'll research on the computers!" the boys said.

33
00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:39.632
"We'll look for books," Izzie and Nina said.

34
00:02:39.633 --> 00:02:44.366
Mr. Dunn called Ethan's mom to tell her about the rash.

35
00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:48.062
Then he gave Ethan an ice pack for his itchy leg.

36
00:02:48.063 --> 00:02:52.496
It helped a little bit.

37
00:02:52.497 --> 00:02:56.137
An hour later the kids gathered on the rug.

38
00:02:56.138 --> 00:03:00.432
"Who wants to share what you found out?" Mr. Dunn asked.

39
00:03:00.433 --> 00:03:02.914
Bobby raised his hand.

40
00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:08.895
"I found out that poison ivy is a plant with an oil that causes a rash."

41
00:03:08.896 --> 00:03:14.720
"You can get the rash from touching the plant or touching something that touched the plant.

42
00:03:14.721 --> 00:03:21.300
Like your shoes," Bobby explained. "Or your pet."

43
00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:25.837
"That's absolutely right," Mr. Dunn said.

44
00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:30.213
"You might not see the rash until the next day," Jason added.

45
00:03:30.214 --> 00:03:38.347
"Right again. The rash usually doesn't appear until 12 to 48 hours later," Mr. Dunn said.

46
00:03:38.348 --> 00:03:40.583
"And not everyone gets it."

47
00:03:40.584 --> 00:03:43.557
"We found some pictures of the rash."

48
00:03:43.558 --> 00:03:46.505
Nina held up a book.

49
00:03:46.506 --> 00:03:49.226
"We also found out how to treat it.

50
00:03:49.227 --> 00:03:55.843
Put anti-itch cream and calamine lotion on it, and take cold, oatmeal baths," Izzie said.

51
00:03:55.844 --> 00:03:58.675
Jason looked through the first aid kit.

52
00:03:58.676 --> 00:04:02.094
"I found calamine lotion!"

53
00:04:02.095 --> 00:04:06.879
"I have to put that pink stuff on me?" Ethan said unhappily.

54
00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.881
"Here's what the poison ivy plant looks like.

55
00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:12.822
So we can all avoid it when we see it."

56
00:04:12.823 --> 00:04:15.622
Izzie showed them pictures.

57
00:04:15.623 --> 00:04:18.439
"There's a special saying to help you remember:

58
00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:24.855
Leaves of three, let them be," Mr. Dunn said.

59
00:04:24.856 --> 00:04:28.647
"Too bad I didn't know all this before," Ethan said.

60
00:04:28.648 --> 00:04:34.100
"I'm itchy. I have to take cold oatmeal baths.

61
00:04:34.101 --> 00:04:38.090
And I have to put on pink lotion—ugh!

62
00:04:38.091 --> 00:04:46.152
I'll stay on the trail from now on!"

63
00:04:46.153 --> 00:04:57.794
[caption_out@
